<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Grupo Iusacell raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Grupo Iusacell raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said analyst Peter Treadway upgraded his rating on Mexican wireless telephone company Grupo Iusacell SA de CV to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- said in report &quot;we are making a bet on management, Mexico and wireless technology.&quot;</p>
<p>-- said sees &quot;further upside still left in stock.&quot;</p>
<p>-- has year-end 1998 price target of $22 on company's ADRs, which ended Tuesday at 18-10/16.</p>
</text>
